   "UNCHANGED FROM f15 AND STILL LIVE. The lexical query is OR-joined rather than a conjunction. NOT on the path despite being merged: 6bfe5808 (document frequencies scoped to the memory population) runs only inside query-anchor-term-memory-df, which executes only under --anchor-source memory-df; the default is :problem-idf and this frame does not flip it. UNFIXED (D60): default-query-term-limit is 4 and the three-source round-robin truncates one slot before the distinctive terms, while text-keywords orders each source by PROBLEM-CORPUS IDF, which against a corpus of mathematics ranks prose words rarest. Expect the lexical route to underperform and the pattern cascade to carry most of the load. f15's student retrieved 0 of 495 available; the retrieval gap is the series' sharpest open finding and this frame replicates the attempt on an adjacent problem."}
